<figure id="A8.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Performance on the <span id="A8.T12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Historical Events</span> task from <span id="A8.T12.6" class="ltx_text">HALoGEN</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib51" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ravichander et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. We report Response Ratio (R<math id="A8.T12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) and Hallucination Score (H<math id="A8.T12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>), both lower is better. Consensus decoding with <span id="A8.T12.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ConGrs</span> consistently achieves low Response Ratio and Hallucination Score for the OLMo model family.</figcaption>
<div id="A8.T12.8" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:98.1pt;vertical-align:-47.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-48.4pt,12.0pt) scale(0.804001021113349,0.804001021113349) ;">
