<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Ablation Experiments</h2>

<section id="A9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.1 </span>Temperature</h3>

<div id="A9.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the biography generation setting with Qwen2.5-72B, we generate responses with different temperatures.
<span id="A9.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ConGrs</span> are effective at synthesizing information across responses even when the responses were generated with various temperatures.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A9.T15" class="ltx_table">
