<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span>Number of responses</h3>

<div id="A9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We generate <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=10</annotation></semantics></math> responses per entity, for a set of <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25</annotation></semantics></math> randomly sampled entities for the biography generation setting with Qwen2.5-72B; with temperatures <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.7</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.7</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.9</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.9</annotation></semantics></math>.
We report results for our consensus decoding method with different threshold <math id="A9.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> values.
<span id="A9.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ConGrs</span> are effective at synthesizing information across 10 responses.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A9.T16" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 16: </span>Ablation results for Qwen2.5-72B (<math id="A9.T16.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=10</annotation></semantics></math>) at different temperatures and <span id="A9.T16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ConGrs</span> thresholds <math id="A9.T16.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>. We report FActScore, number of supported (#T) and unsupported facts (#F), and response ratio (R) averaged across the <math id="A9.T16.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25</annotation></semantics></math> sampled entities.</figcaption>
